                        ✅ Yes {p.id === 'FREE' ? `(up to ${p.notetakerMinutes || 30} mins)` : ''}
                      </span>
                    </td>
                  ))}
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td className="feature-name-cell">• Meeting Mode (Mic + Zoom/Teams audio)</td>
                  {plans.map((p) => (
